<p id="S1.p4.2" class="ltx_p">The part <math id="S1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{join}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{join}</annotation></semantics></math> glues together a subset <math id="S1.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> of the <math id="S1.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>- and <math id="S1.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>-decorated external vertices, where</p>
<ul id="S1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S1.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|S|\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|S|\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S1.I2.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> contains either 0 or 1 of the <math id="S1.I2.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>-decorated vertices</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="S1.p4.3" class="ltx_p">and then attaches an edge to a new external vertex. The new edge is decorated by <math id="S1.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="S1.p4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> contains an <math id="S1.p4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>-decorated vertex, and by <math id="S1.p4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math> otherwise:</p>
