<p id="S3.Thmthm1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The special vertex is drawn with a double cirle, and decorated by <math id="S3.Thmthm1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa\in H^{2}(\overline{{\mathcal{M}}}_{3,3})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa\in H^{2}(\overline{{\mathcal{M}}}_{3,3})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
