<p id="S3.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">To indicate a decoration <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{a,A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{a,A}</annotation></semantics></math>, we replace the special vertex with two vertices connected by a marked edge.</p>
