</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p5.3" class="ltx_p">Here, the second sum is again taken over all ways of distributing the half-edges incident to the special vertex over the two new vertices of genus <math id="S3.SS3.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS3.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> such that the resulting graph is stable.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Next, we discuss the formulas for <math id="S3.SS3.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})</annotation></semantics></math>. In the special case where <math id="S3.SS3.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A=S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A=S</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</p>
<table id="S3.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex40.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{cases}\delta_{2b-h,S\cup\{q\}}-\psi_{q}&amp; \text{if $(b,B)=(a,S)$ or $(b,B)=(h-a,\emptyset)$;}\\
\delta_{b,B}+\delta_{b+a-h,B\cup\{q\}}&amp;\text{otherwise.}\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mtext> or </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mtext>;</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise.</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\begin{cases}\delta_{2b-h,S\cup\{q\}}-\psi_{q}&amp; \text{if $(b,B)=(a,S)$ or $(b,B)=(h-a,\emptyset)$;}\\
\delta_{b,B}+\delta_{b+a-h,B\cup\{q\}}&amp;\text{otherwise.}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p6.2" class="ltx_p">If <math id="S3.SS3.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A\neq S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A\neq S</annotation></semantics></math> then</p>
<table id="S3.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\theta^{*}(\delta_{b,B})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex41.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{cases}-\psi_{q}&amp; \text{if $(b,B)=(a,A)$ or $(b,B)=(h-a,A^{c})$};\\
\delta_{b,B}&amp;\text{if $B\subset A$ and $(b,B)\neq(a,A)$};\\
\delta_{b+a-h,(B\smallsetminus A^{c})\cup\{q\}}&amp;\text{if $B\supset A^{c}$ and $(b,B)\neq(h-a,A^{c})$};\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}.\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mtext> or </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mtext> and </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∖</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⊃</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mtext> and </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>otherwise</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\begin{cases}-\psi_{q}&amp; \text{if $(b,B)=(a,A)$ or $(b,B)=(h-a,A^{c})$};\\
\delta_{b,B}&amp;\text{if $B\subset A$ and $(b,B)\neq(a,A)$};\\
\delta_{b+a-h,(B\smallsetminus A^{c})\cup\{q\}}&amp;\text{if $B\supset A^{c}$ and $(b,B)\neq(h-a,A^{c})$};\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p7.2" class="ltx_p">Again, the resulting action of <math id="S3.SS3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{split}</annotation></semantics></math> on a special vertex with decoration <math id="S3.SS3.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{b,B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{b,B}</annotation></semantics></math> has a convenient graphic depiction:</p>
<table id="S3.E14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S3.E14X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_left">(14)</span></td>
