<div id="S3.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Next, consider pullback <math id="S3.SS3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, which is related to <math id="S3.SS3.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{loop}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{loop}</annotation></semantics></math> at the special vertex. We have</p>
<table id="S3.Ex42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center">
<div id="S3.Ex42.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_markedasmath ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:327.8pt;height:18.8pt;vertical-align:-7.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-62.8pt,3.6pt) scale(0.722853389925793,0.722853389925793) ;">
<p id="S3.Ex42.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S3.Ex42.m1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\xi^{*}\kappa=\kappa,\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \xi^{*}\psi_{j}=\psi_{j},\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \mbox{ and }\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \xi^{*}\delta_{a,A}=\begin{cases}\delta_{a,A}&amp;\text{if $h=2a$, $A=S=\emptyset$}\\
\delta_{a,A}+\delta_{a-1,A\cup\{t,t^{\prime}\}}&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}\,." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo rspace="4.667em">,</mo><mi>ξ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi>ψ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ψ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo rspace="4.667em">,</mo><mtext> and </mtext><mi>ξ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi>δ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><mtext>, </mtext><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi^{*}\kappa=\kappa,\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \xi^{*}\psi_{j}=\psi_{j},\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \mbox{ and }\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \xi^{*}\delta_{a,A}=\begin{cases}\delta_{a,A}&amp;\text{if $h=2a$, $A=S=\emptyset$}\\
\delta_{a,A}+\delta_{a-1,A\cup\{t,t^{\prime}\}}&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}\,.</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</span></div></td>
