<p id="S3.SS3.p8.2" class="ltx_p">These algebraic rules correspond to the following pictorial definition of <math id="S3.SS3.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{loop}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{loop}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
