<div id="S5.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, suppose the special vertex of <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> is decorated by <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math>. The differential <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{res}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{res}</annotation></semantics></math> sends <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> to a <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(-1)^{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>e</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(-1)^{e}</annotation></semantics></math>-times a graph whose special vertex is decorated by <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{i}+\psi_{j}-\sum_{i\in S,j\in S^{c}}\delta_{0,S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{i}+\psi_{j}-\sum_{i\in S,j\in S^{c}}\delta_{0,S}</annotation></semantics></math>. The <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{0,S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{0,S}</annotation></semantics></math>-terms can be dropped upon applying <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math>. The two <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ψ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi</annotation></semantics></math>-terms produce graphs</span></p>
