<p id="S5.SS3.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">where one has to remember that in each case the <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>-edge adjacent to the depicted vertex is the first in the ordering.
Furthermore, note that the two factors <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(-1)^{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>e</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(-1)^{e}</annotation></semantics></math> from the definitions of <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{res}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{res}</annotation></semantics></math> cancel.
Next consider the terms <math id="S5.SS3.p5.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{split}^{s}\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{split}^{s}\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, which are given by replacing the special vertex by two vertices in one of three ways as follows:</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex92" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

