<p id="S7.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text">arising from <math id="S7.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{join}^{\epsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{join}^{\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math> joins all <math id="S7.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>-legs into one.</span></p>
