<p id="S7.p9.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.3.1" class="ltx_text">However, we can continue in the same fashion and filter the cokernel of <math id="S7.p9.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> as</span></p>
