<p id="S8.Thmthm4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.Thmthm4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">with the <math id="S8.Thmthm4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>-ary part of the cyclic Lie operad <math id="S8.Thmthm4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{Lie}((n))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖫𝗂𝖾</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Lie}((n))</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
