<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, if neither <math id="A1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math>-decoration is adjacent to an internal vertex then we set <math id="A1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F(\gamma)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F(\gamma)=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmthm1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmthm1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmthm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmthm1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmthm1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmthm1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The map <math id="A1.Thmthm1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="F\colon X_{g,n}\to\overline{\mathsf{GK}}{}_{g,n}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>X</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝖦𝖪</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F\colon X_{g,n}\to\overline{\mathsf{GK}}{}_{g,n}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is a map of complexes and fits into a homotopy commutative triangle</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex182" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.Ex182.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="74.35" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-37.18px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 139.09 74.35" width="139.09"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="translate(0,74.35) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(69.55,0) translate(0,37.18)"><g stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -69.55 -28.15)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 74.35)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 16.33)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 2.43 0) translate(25.26,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -19.31 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.74em;--ltx-fo-height:0.72em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.95" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.99)" width="24.1"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="A1.Ex182.m1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\lx@inpgf@ignorespaces\widetilde{\mathsf{GK}}{}_{g,n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝖦𝖪</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\lx@inpgf@ignorespaces\widetilde{\mathsf{GK}}{}_{g,n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 55.39 0) translate(58.83,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -18.92 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.69em;--ltx-fo-height:0.81em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="15.22" overflow="visible" transfo